---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="GS1 Digital Link & High-Speed Serialization | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Industrial 2D QR code serialization and GS1 Digital Link resolver pipeline for high-speed battery pack and cell production lines."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">GS1 Digital Link & Serialization</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        High-Speed Factory Serialization & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">GS1 Digital Link Resolver</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Every battery pack, module, and cell requires a permanent, machine-readable 2D data carrier compliant with GS1 Digital Link and ISO/IEC 15459 standards.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary">
          Contact Serialization Engineers →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Capabilities Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-16">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-7">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          🏷️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">GS1 Digital Link Syntax</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Embeds standard GTIN and unique serial numbers (AI 21) into standard web-resolvable URIs for instant scanning by both consumer smartphones and customs laser readers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-7">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Plant MES Integration</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          High-throughput API generating up to 10,000 unique serialized QR tokens per minute, directly interfacing with Keyence, Trumpf, and Domino industrial laser marking lines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-7">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          🌐
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Global Resolver SLA</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Decentralized DNS resolver on the Cloudflare edge network, delivering typical sub-50ms latency across Europe, North America and Asia.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Action Card -->
    <div class="neo-surface p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Request Plant Serialization Review</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Let our engineers evaluate your factory MES/laser marking pipeline and GS1 Digital Link mapping.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Email: info@eudppprovider.com</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
